  "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $\\frac{17}{18}?$",
  "worked_solution": "We flip the numerator and denominator, keeping the sign of the fraction. So the reciprocal of $\\frac{17}{18}$ is  $\\frac{18}{17}.$",
